{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072060/extras/d2c49dfeef8c7a3286c63263432d5f44.avif?t=1760605424\" width=1318 height=370 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Libertine </strong>is a narrative-rich roguelike card game set in the bowels of an illegal underground casino, where the house always takes its cut - in flesh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072060/extras/9e2e16d9e6fc34862f0c75d62f12cb17.avif?t=1760605424\" data-has-big width=1560 height=617 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off a series of diverse characters in stressful card game duels, wagering both chips and the fingers off your hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each opponent you face is more than a set of cards. Study each of their personalities and playstyles, learn their tells, and read their intentions with each raise, check, and fold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072060/extras/044e74beb06d4d22aa15fd645737fd35.poster.avif?t=1760605424\" width=500 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072060/extras/044e74beb06d4d22aa15fd645737fd35.webm?t=1760605424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072060/extras/044e74beb06d4d22aa15fd645737fd35.mp4?t=1760605424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategize, bluff and pray luck is on your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no matter what, never forget - <strong>The house always wins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072060/extras/2c8482c751fd785b376f67c734521a77.poster.avif?t=1760605424\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072060/extras/2c8482c751fd785b376f67c734521a77.webm?t=1760605424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072060/extras/2c8482c751fd785b376f67c734521a77.mp4?t=1760605424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a demo of <i>Libertine</i>. It includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three rounds of gameplay with unique opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of items to help you win big.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An environment that changes as you progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features and assets are subject to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072060?t=1760605424","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4072060?t=1760605424","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072060/b945a3a0386aa23812ffdf9e86414edbbd632d83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760605424","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072060/b945a3a0386aa23812ffdf9e86414edbbd632d83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760605424","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Stylized depictions of violence/severing of fingers. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><